      47.85,
      369.13,
      539.96,
      416.2
    ],
    "text": "KNOW Ye that virtue of powers vested by the Article 154(b):8(b) of the Thirteenth Amendment to the Constitution of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Niluka Ekanayake, Governor of the Central Province, do by this NoticeProrogue the fourth Session of the Sixth Provincial Council of the Central Province with effect from 09th December TwoThousand Sixteen.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      429.13,
      539.94,
      464.2
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of powers vested in me by Paragraph 8(a) of the said Article, I, do hereby summon the said Council tomeet at the Chamber of the Central Province Provincial Council Complex at Pallekele, Kundasale on Monday the 06thFebruary Two Thousand Seventeen at 10.00 a. m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
